<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch car sales rise 2.6 pct in Q1 1997.</title>
<headline>Dutch car sales rise 2.6 pct in Q1 1997.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales of new passenger cars in the Netherlands rose 2.6 percent in the first quarter of 1997 to 158,991 from 154,981 in the same period of 1996, the automobile trade association RAI said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The association said it expected sales of about 465,000 cars for the whole of this year.</p>
<p>In 1996 sales of new cars in the Netherlands rose six percent to 473,474.</p>
